Z||000000||lennyb4||05-25-2000||11:24 AM||||OK fellow fieroites..Ive been studying our little cars for a while now. I am planning on sticking her in the garage this fall (daily driver now)and doing a 100% resto and motor swap. Including everything down to sanding and painting the space frame. Now to the point, Has anyone here ever done this before or know anyone that has? If so any tips/tricks/secrets would be greatly appreciated.  TIA||||reg||6
